[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920LayoutResX: 1920LayoutResY: 1080PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Warning,Impress BT Pace,90,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:02:00.09,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.43,0:01:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you get on board?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world...?Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.27,0:02:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you do?Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.39,0:02:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Sogeking, King of Snipers.Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.48,0:02:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To make a long story short, I've come to rescue you.Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.86,0:02:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose...Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not just me.Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.86,0:02:17.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Sanji and a thug named Franky are currently engaged in battle on this train.Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.45,0:02:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It gave me a chance to come here.Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, Sir Luffy and the othersDialogue: 50,0:02:21.79,0:02:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are pursuing us on this very railway aboard another sea train…Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're bringing quite a few allies.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On my way here, I peeked inside through the windows.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frankly, the team of four in the car behind us is dangerous.Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd be best if I could get you out of here before Sir Sanji confronts them.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let us escape...Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,together!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm all prepared.Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These octoshoes are for you.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wear these on your hands and feetDialogue: 50,0:03:13.07,0:03:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so that we can climb out the window  and cling to the sea train.Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, put them on before they notice.Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait.Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Wait"?Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.85,0:03:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could this be happening?Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I clearly told you all goodbye.Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never return to the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.90,0:03:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They know why you are so insistent about that.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.95,0:03:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that the Ice fellow at the shipyard clarified everything.Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he survived?Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.29,0:03:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so...Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't return to you guys...Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough of that!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not so weak that you need to worry about them!Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.76,0:04:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They really wish you would've spoken to them before taking such a stupid deal!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.81,0:04:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think they'd be happy to be aliveDialogue: 50,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,knowing their friend gave her life for theirs?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that they know why you left them,Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.44,0:04:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll follow you to the depths of hell  and take down your enemies!Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still don't get what kind of man Luffy is!Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's you guys who don't get it!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.79,0:04:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have the slightest desire to be rescued!Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't just do as you please!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, you–Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you making a racket for, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.10,0:04:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that we're approaching Enies Lobby, is it hard for even you to remain calm?Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cry about your fate all you like.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.94,0:04:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't do anything to save your life.Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Very suspicious...Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, she seems different somehow…Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.33,0:05:15.00,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it just my imagination?Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.71,0:05:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.05,0:05:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so please leave me alone.Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.97,0:05:24.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.10,0:05:27.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is this woman goofing around?Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A rabbit...?Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of ramen kenpo!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What sort of power-up...?Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.62,0:05:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo:Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pork Bone Spank!Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that just a bigger version of the same worthless punch?Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now! Another one!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm stuck!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dummy!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.79,0:06:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you taken aback by my ramen kenpo?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.34,0:06:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look unsightly with your leg and arm buried in ramen noodles!Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.51,0:06:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, beating the snot outta me earlier?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.19,0:06:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously getting dizzy on me?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.19,0:07:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You tried to make me woozy with your eyebrows again!Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you get away with it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.79,0:07:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't fight back like this!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noodle Soul Press!Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another helping!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another!Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another!Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another!Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.15,0:07:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that, and that!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They finally came off.Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you underestimating me, you dummy?Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.54,0:08:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the mad, mad ramen kenpo!Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I attack, I get buried in ramen...Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.43,0:08:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't touch those noodles.Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll keep it coming!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen-Gyoza Combo:Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clapping!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.94,0:08:30.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So there's only one place I can aim for, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Éscalope!Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.00,0:08:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Beam!Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got no blind spot!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.77,0:09:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From what I've seen, your fighting style is made up of kicks, isn't it?Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're helpless without your kicks, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use! It's no use!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.74,0:09:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,  you'll only end up being buried in my suit!Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here goes! Try dodging this!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo:Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Multi-Noodle Spank!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.89,0:09:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fedelini: a 1.4 millimeter pasta...Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.44,0:09:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sleight of hand...?Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cut my noodle fists to pieces!Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.16,0:09:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hands and kitchen knives are sacred to cooks.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's my policy not to use them in a battle.Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if this is a kitchen...Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.92,0:10:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and my enemy is made of food, then it's a different story.Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're more troublesome than I thought.Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thousand-Noodle Whip!Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trying to look cool?Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How saucy!Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.57,0:10:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An amateur like you who can't even  cook shouldn't hold kitchen knives!Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.28,0:10:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're different from the knives that delinquents use!Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for being saucy.Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Accept this as a token of my apology.Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you...Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how a first-class cook...Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,masterfully wields his kitchen knives!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.56,0:11:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.56,0:11:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Hammer!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art.Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.57,0:11:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fresh Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.38,0:11:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?! What's his deal?! He just went and jumped off the train!Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd he bounce back here in midair?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.31,0:11:48.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can't I cut him with Tempest Kick?Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.56,0:11:52.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something weird about his body!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the hell...Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we close to the Bashing Tom yet?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's "Puffing"!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Stay inside!Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just changed, but you're soaking wet again!Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's okay!Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like it up here!Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.01,0:12:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez...Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Hundred-Pound...Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...Cannon! – ...Cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.44,0:12:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Boom! – Boom!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Splash! – Splash!Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ahh! This is it! Laguna! – Ahh! This is it! Laguna!Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time for playing around!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.99,0:12:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We're bored. – We're bored.Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.99,0:12:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go polish your weapons or something, you idiots!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, um...Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.45,0:12:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to those guys later, so...Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see a train up ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.22,0:13:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– That's gotta be the Puffing Tom! – That's gotta be the Puffing Tom!Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too early?Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to us?Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no engine on this car. All we can do is wait for rescue.Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.48,0:13:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! We're rocking!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.82,0:13:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what are the odds of rescue in a storm like this?Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. There's something coming from behind!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.12,0:13:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be a rescue ship!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.49,0:13:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like...Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.37,0:13:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's coming along the tracks.Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.21,0:13:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't be...Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one sea train in the world.Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.71,0:13:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, nothing could've left Water Seven after that last departure.Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.30,0:13:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.39,0:13:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what the heck is coming?Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.27,0:13:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a sea train, but it's just cars without the locomotive!Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's blocking the track!Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that they got detached?Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Sanji and Usopp might be on them!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Big Bro Franky, too! – Big Bro Franky, too!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll crash for sure!Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lady! Where's the brake?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said it doesn't work, didn't I?Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do something.Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.21,0:14:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.80,0:14:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! What're you gonna do?Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.63,0:14:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go check inside!Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Rocket!Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.72,0:14:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's flying...Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.33,0:14:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! I got in!Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.42,0:14:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello! Sanji! Are you in here?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.67,0:15:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello! Sanji! Hello!Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe over there?Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy... Could it be...!Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello!Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you here, Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.12,0:15:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.29,0:15:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no escape for you!Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Sanji?Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's that?Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! He's my friend!Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.93,0:15:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know a guy like that!Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.14,0:15:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, see ya.Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is coming out!Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's saying that they're not in there... while being shot!Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.11,0:16:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, everyone in there is government personnel, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.12,0:16:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what're you gonna do if so?Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't move those cars, we'll take a lot of damage, too!Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a sea train, all right!Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.09,0:16:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get knocked off!Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worse, we could all go up in a huge explosion!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Franky Family's time to shine.Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll demolish them right before we crash!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! We'll give you guys a hand, too!Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! It's time to work!Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Roronoa. He's calling your name.Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.70,0:16:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut them. They're in our way.Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.91,0:16:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– "Sure"?! – "Sure"?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ego of the entropic world...Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,can be slashed into pieces.Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.65,0:17:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style Draw...Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rashomon!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.92,0:17:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.77,0:18:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.10,0:18:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could've told us you were gonna do that.Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard me saying, "Cut them," right?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.53,0:18:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't think he actually could!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We would've crashed if he didn't cut them, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.74,0:18:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess that's true, but a little heads up would've been nice!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.62,0:18:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're telling me a monster like him isn't even the captain?Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a sea king!Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.47,0:18:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Further ahead on this railway...Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.51,0:18:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lies the one who cut that thing up!Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.02,0:18:53.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, return to the front cars! It's a trap!Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,– A trap?! – A trap?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think that I fell for the enemy's scheme...Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a blunder!Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gravest blunder of my life!Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.75,0:19:11.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, gentlemen! Have a nice trip!Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to catch up with the sea train!Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.39,0:19:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the criminals we're supposed to escort are set free upon the world again...Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.48,0:19:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how much blood and how many tears will civilians have to shed?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.82,0:19:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show them that there's justice even in this unfair world!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.49,0:19:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if my arms and legs are torn off by these raging waves...Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.28,0:19:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will be sure to protect the future of innocent citizens!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea train?Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a new sea train?Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something there!Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.93,0:20:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A person? There's someone there!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Ship Slasher!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– S-Seriously?! – S-Seriously?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ship Slasher?Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.15,0:20:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's Ship Slasher T-Bone, a captain at Marine Headquarters!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.11,0:21:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He cuts pirate ships up like steaks!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.32,0:21:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.83,0:21:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Amazing"?! You're talking like it's someone else's problem!Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't just sit around like this.Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Get ready to fire!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.46,0:21:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.76,0:21:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.64,0:21:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry up or he'll slash Rocketman!Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you watching earlier?Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Zoro.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.31,0:21:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you only once!Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way!Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.49,0:21:47.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My subordinates' cars were on the same railway, so they couldn't have simply passed them by.Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.62,0:21:50.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What did these people do to my men?Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They must be Nico Robin's crewmates...Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.63,0:21:56.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,which means that swordsman is the Pirate Hunter!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.71,0:22:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This path leads to the seat of justice!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a captain from Marine Headquarters!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not live in disgrace!Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.31,0:22:11.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you fiends by slashing you in two!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't allow that...Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.81,0:22:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as our destination lies beyond where you stand!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy is strong!Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.53,0:22:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I detest crooked swordplay!Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.38,0:22:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right-Angle Flying Bird:Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.55,0:22:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.96,0:22:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bull Demon!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone...Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Phoenix!Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He saw through it?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.87,0:23:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Courageous Talons!Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.05,0:23:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat the Ship Slasher!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.68,0:23:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think that he followed the sea train from the detached cars in this storm...Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.23,0:23:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How admirable!Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we can't stop here.Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.86,0:23:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the burden of your justice is heavy, but we also shoulder our own burden.Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.20,0:23:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.95,0:23:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone jumped out to sea! He's in danger!Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.33,0:23:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He could've been hit by that sea train by now.Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.38,0:24:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch your tongue, Marine!Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.38,0:24:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should know that our captain would slash that train in two!Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.26,0:24:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Is that right?Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.52,0:24:20.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! I'm sure it's Sanji and the others who detached that sea train.Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.15,0:24:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, are we gonna catch up with them soon?Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.52,0:24:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably.Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.57,0:24:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! We're closing in on our enemy!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.61,0:24:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Rocketman!Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.70,0:24:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat up that pigeon jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:54.09,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Honorable Captain T-BoneDialogue: 1,0:01:50.13,0:01:54.09,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Honorable Captain T-BoneDialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:37.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji vs. Wanze Car FourDialogue: 1,0:05:34.02,0:05:37.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji vs. Wanze Car FourDialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky vs. Nero Rooftop, Car ThreeDialogue: 1,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky vs. Nero Rooftop, Car ThreeDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality