 heartsDialogue: 2,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 2,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 1,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 2,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 1,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 2,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,2,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,2,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,2,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 1,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 2,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,, Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 1,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,, Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 2,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,, Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 1,0:00:55.06,0: